      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know, i'm not trying to be reckless but i really can't get an appointment for a few days and the pain is making it hard to walk. i've taken ibuprofen before and it was fine. is there like a standard safe dose that won't mess with the eliquis too much? i just need something to get me through the weekend.",
